ss or swelling further supports the likelihood of a neurological complication rather than a local inflammatory response. Given the timing of the symptoms, it is crucial to recognize this as a potential vaccine-associated injury, emphasizing the importance of proper injection techniques to prevent such complications. The child's age also highlights the need for careful monitoring and possible rehabilitation to address any functional impairments resulting from this injury. \n"], "raw_output": "'''Option: B'''"}
